-06-19T16:54:35Z"},"comments":1,"created_at":"2026-02-15T16:38:18Z","updated_at":"2026-05-06T20:00:05Z","closed_at":"2026-05-06T20:00:05Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nGodot v4.7.dev1.official [bf95b6258]\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.7.dev1 - Windows 10 (build 19045)\n\n### Issue description\n\nIf you modify any property in VirtualJoystick after adding your own InputMaps, messages like this will be displayed in the output:\n\n```\n--- Debugging process stopped ---\n  ERROR: The InputMap action \"player_left\" doesn't exist. Did you mean \"ui_left\"?\n  ERROR: The InputMap action \"player_right\" doesn't exist. Did you mean \"ui_right\"?\n  ERROR: The InputMap action \"player_down\" doesn't exist. Did you mean \"ui_down\"?\n  ERROR: The InputMap action \"player_up\" doesn't exist.\n```\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Go to: `Project` > `Project Settings ...` > `Input Map`.\n1. Add a new `Action` with a name like `player_up`.\n1. Add a `VirtualJoystick` to your scene and select `player_up` in the \"Action Up\" menu.\n1. Change joystick_size or tip_size in the inspector.\n\nResult after changing joystick_size:\n\n<img width=\"674\" height=\"206\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/fb72548d-2450-41d9-96ca-3a83873b82a8\" />\n\nChanging properties other than joystick_size and tip_size does not produce this error message.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nThis is not applicable; the problem is with the editor.\n\n**Note:** Changes made during gameplay work normally. So this is safe (as far as I've tested):\n\n```gdscript\nvar x: VirtualJoystick = %VirtualJoystick\nx.tip_size = 100.0\nx.joystick_size = 200.0\n```\n\nProbably because of this:\n\n* https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/bf95b62586e31b8a3503f5903d7764d7c52bf2ab/scene/gui/virtual_joystick.cpp#L190\n* https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/bf95b62586e31b8a3503f5903d7764d7c52bf2ab/core/input/input_map.cpp#L272","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116321/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116321/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}